{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56764","headline":"柳归舜闻君山鹦鹉所唱歌诗（题） 一 · 不详","name":"柳归舜闻君山鹦鹉所唱歌诗（题） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戴蝉儿，分明传与君王语。\n建章殿里未得归，朱箔金缸双凤舞。\n（唱歌者云此曲是汉武钩弋夫人常所唱）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}